flowchart TD
 R["Read from device"] --> P["Polling"]
 R --> I["Interrupt-driven I/O"]
 R --> D["DMA"]
 P --> PS["CPU checks readiness"]
 PS --> PT["CPU transfers data"]
 I --> IS["Device signals readiness"]
 IS --> IT["CPU handles data transfer"]
 D --> DS["CPU configures a block"]
 DS --> DT["Controller transfers to RAM"]
 DT --> DC["Controller signals completion"]
